commit 8ad9e3da
author: cdvankammen
date: 2026-10-24 04:01:55 -0600
subject: fix(tests): tasktype-tracking + empty-choices + openrouter-usage flags

- src/lib/db/repos/usageRepo.js: saveRequestUsage INSERT now includes
  conversationId column and passes entry.meta (not empty {}) so
  taskType + conversationId round-trip through usageHistory
- open-sse/handlers/chatCore/sseToJsonHandler.js: parseSSEToOpenAIResponse
  distinguishes truly-empty input (no data lines → null) from
  [DONE]-only streams (returns valid empty completion object with
  choices:[]) so downstream handlers see well-formed responses
- open-sse/providers/registry/openrouter.js: add features.usage and
  features.usageApikey flags so USAGE_SUPPORTED_PROVIDERS and
  USAGE_APIKEY_PROVIDERS include openrouter

MiMo E APPROVE (tasktype-tracking)
MiMo F APPROVE (empty-choices)
MiMo G APPROVE (openrouter-usage)


